  message: "PR #2354 (stable-id v19, 2026-11-23/24): two package agents (types, jsts) met the two test_sketch embedding-mode failures while running under a private XDG_CACHE_HOME; the jsts agent showed they fail identically with its changed sources reverted (pre-existing). The coordinator's whole-suite run on 3aee701ff did not hit them (its cache setting not recorded in STATUS.md) (1 failed, an unrelated id-newtype gate fixed in 039a2f5f5; 44,630 passed). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/types/RESULTS.md \"Tests run\", jsts/RESULTS.md \"Gates\", STATUS.md lines 93 and 209."  # 05c3
